title: MarkUP — Markdown with components
description: A Markdown-compatible language with components, a real parser, a desktop editor, a VS Code extension and a CLI.
---

# MarkUP

**Markdown with components.** Everything you know from Markdown still works; components add structure where plain Markdown runs out. One language core powers a desktop editor, a VS Code extension and a command-line tool.

**[Download for Windows](download.md)** · [Get started](getting-started.md) · [See every component](components.md)

