## The tools

:::::columns
::::column
:::card[MarkUP Desktop]{href="download.md" icon="🖥️"}
A focused editor: file explorer, tabs, live preview, search, outline and problems — with completion and quick fixes that understand the language. [Download](download.md) · [Tour](desktop.md)
:::
::::
::::column
:::card[VS Code extension]{href="vscode.md" icon="🧩"}
Highlighting, completion, hover, diagnostics with quick fixes, outline and a live preview beside the editor. [Download](download.md#vs-code-extension)
:::
::::
::::column
:::card[Command line]{href="cli.md" icon="⌨️"}
`markup build` turns documents into standalone pages, `check` finds problems, `preview` serves one with live reload.
:::
::::
:::::

